  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, chili pepper, and garlic. Cook for 4 minutes.",
    "Add split peas, cumin, coriander powder, and salt. Stir to combine.",
    "Pour in water, then bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, then cover saucepan with a lid.",
    "Simmer for 25 minutes or until split peas are al dente.",
    "Stir in mustard paste, then cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and lemon juice.",
    "Serve hot with your choice of accompaniments."
